  "published": "2026-10-18T15:10:54.39Z",
  "releaseNotes": "🍀Added `IUserSlideShapeCollection.AddOleObject()` to embed Word, Excel, and PowerPoint documents on slides with a preview image  \n🍀Added `IMedia.StartMode` to read and set audio playback to In Click Sequence, Automatically, or When Clicked On\n🐞Reduced memory use of both `Slides.Add` import overloads by removing the whole-source presentation clone",
